  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Editing of riskstudy &amp; q/a of guidance INCAF - Editing of riskstudy &amp; q/a of</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Red av riskstudie &amp; kval s&#xE4;kring av riktlinjer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En riskstudie har utarbetats inom INCAFs arbetsgrupp f&#xF6;r finansiering och bist&#xE5;ndsarkitektur och ska publiceras inom DACs serie &quot;conflict and fragility&quot;. ODI kontrakters att redigera rapporten inf&#xF6;r publiceringen. ODI kontrakteras ocks&#xE5; f&#xF6;r att ing&#xE5; i en expertgrupp f&#xF6;r granskning av kvalit&#xE9;n i arbetet med riktlinjer f&#xF6;r transitionsfinansiering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The INCAF Task Team on Financing and Aid Architecture has developed a risk study that is to be published in the DAC serie &quot;conflict and fragility&quot;. ODI has been contracted to edit the report before its publication. ODI has also been contracted to form part of an expert group that works with quality assuring the work related to a guidance for transitionfinancing.</narrative>
  </description>
